{{Quote|Allows the user to manipulate gravity, controlling the battlefield.|Shop}}
'''Gravity''' is a {{Mythical}} [[Natural]]-type [[Blox Fruit]] that costs {{Money|2,500,000}} or {{Robux|2,300}} from the [[Blox Fruit Dealer]].

[[Natural|Gravity]] allows the user to manipulate and control gravitational forces within their surroundings, granting the ability to affect a wide range of elements on the battlefield. 

